al significance is assessed via McNemar's test on paired binary instance outcomes (SpecExtract-Agentless vs. Agentless-direct), with bootstrapped CIs reported for the resolve-rate difference.'\n\nWith these three additions — particularly (1) — the proposal will have addressed all substantive issues from rounds 1-8 and should be ready to pass in Round 9.",
